### Pruebas de la API (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code: clic en "Send Request")
@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### ===== LOGIN (ejecuta este primero, guarda el token) =====
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@universidad.edu", "password": "Admin123*" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Registro de usuario nuevo
POST {{url}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Nuevo Asesor", "email": "nuevo@universidad.edu", "password": "123456" }

### Perfil del usuario logueado
GET {{url}}/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial de sesiones
GET {{url}}/auth/sesiones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar sesión (invalida el token)
POST {{url}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Info
GET {{url}}

### ===== FACULTADES =====
GET {{url}}/facultades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{url}}/facultades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Facultad de Derecho",
  "codigo": "DER",
  "decano": "Dr. Felipe Castro",
  "descripcion": "Ciencias jurídicas y políticas"
}

###
GET {{url}}/facultades/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{url}}/facultades/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decano": "Dra. Ana Torres" }

###
DELETE {{url}}/facultades/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== PROGRAMAS =====
GET {{url}}/programas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por nivel / facultad
GET {{url}}/programas?nivel=Pregrado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{url}}/programas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Derecho",
  "codigo": "DER-DER",
  "facultad": "PEGAR_ID_FACULTAD",
  "nivel": "Pregrado",
  "modalidad": "Presencial",
  "duracionSemestres": 10,
  "cupos": 50,
  "valorSemestre": 6000000
}

###
GET {{url}}/programas/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{url}}/programas/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ESTUDIANTES =====
GET {{url}}/estudiantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar / filtrar
GET {{url}}/estudiantes?buscar=valentina&estado=Admitido
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inscribir estudiante
POST {{url}}/estudiantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoDocumento": "CC",
  "documento": "1012345678",
  "nombres": "Juan",
  "apellidos": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@correo.com",
  "telefono": "3105556677",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2007-04-15",
  "colegio": "Colegio Nacional",
  "puntajeIcfes": 350,
  "programa": "PEGAR_ID_PROGRAMA"
}

### Cambiar estado de admisión
PATCH {{url}}/estudiantes/PEGAR_ID_AQUI/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estadoAdmision": "Admitido" }

###
PUT {{url}}/estudiantes/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "telefono": "3000000000" }

###
DELETE {{url}}/estudiantes/PEGAR_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ESTADÍSTICAS =====
GET {{url}}/estadisticas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
